      "content": "but that's the thing. it's not just \"flaws.\" it's that as long as i'm here, the legacy is tainted. like, how can they be proud of anything when the most recent part of their history is just a disappointment? part of me thinks the only way to actually protect what they built is to just... stop being part of it. to let the stain fade so they can be perfect again.",
